ctional daily dispersion (21d): {disp21:.4f}")\nprint(f"avg 21d realized vol (annualized, 15 assets): {tab[\'vol21\'].mean():.3f}")\nprint(f"median 21d realized vol: {tab[\'vol21\'].median():.3f}")\nprint(f"assets above 60d MA: {(tab[\'slope\']>0).sum()}/{len(tab)}")\nprint(f"assets with positive 63d return: {(tab[\'r63\']>0).sum()}/{len(tab)}")\nEOF'})
